The '''mrahcemiT esrevrorriM''' (Mirrorverse Timecharm) is a {{Special}} [[Rift Timecharms|Rift Timecharm]].

== Obtaining ==
The player can purchase a '''mrahcemiT esrevrorriM''' from {{NPCSprite|Dr. Emmett}} after completing all seven {{zone|Mirrorverse}} puzzles for {{Item|Shadow Crux|amount=10}}es {{Motes|10,000}}.

== Usage ==
The player can secure the '''mrahcemiT esrevrorriM''' in the {{zone|Rift Gallery}} to gain {{SkyBlock XP|+100}}, and along with the {{Item|Chicken N Egg Timecharm}}, to unlock access to the {{zone|Village Plaza}} and thus all of the following locations:

*{{zone|Barry Center}}
*{{zone|Barry HQ}}
*{{zone|Empty Bank}}
*{{zone|Book in a Book}}
*{{zone|Déjà Vu Alley}}
*{{zone|Half-Eaten Cave}}
*{{zone|Lonely Terrace}}
*{{zone|Murder House}}
*{{zone|Taylor's}}
*{{zone|"Your" Island}}

=== Game Message ===
Securing the '''mrahcemiT esrevrorriM''' will result in the following message, which will be broadcast to the entire lobby:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&d&lRIFTASTIC! &7[player] &ehas secured &cmrahcemiT esrevrorriM&e into their gallery! &6gg&e!}}}}
=== Rift Necklace ===
{{Main|Rift Necklace}}
Securing the '''mrahcemiT esrevrorriM''' will add additional [[stats]] to the [[Rift Necklace]] both inside and outside the [[Rift Dimension]].

